⚡🇪🇬 Egypt has discovered an estimated 200 billion cubic feet of natural gas in place at the Naseem-1X well in the Mediterranean Sea.

Drilled by Petrobel on behalf of Eni and Woodside, the well contains a 15-meter gas-bearing layer. A 22-kilometer pipeline is planned to connect it to existing infrastructure, according to the Egyptian Ministry of Petroleum.

